You release a surge of adrenaline that increases your Physical Power by [17, 22, 26, 29, 32 (TL1-5; CON 100)] for [3, 4, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] turns. While the effect is active, you may continue to fight beyond the point of exhaustion.

You may continue to use stamina based talents while at zero stamina at the cost of life.

The Physical Power increase will scale with your Constitution.

Using this talent does not take a turn.
